<ExampleSentences>
<AStr ws="en">
<Run ws="en">What is the &lt;relation&gt; between the two?; How are they &lt;related&gt;?; The &lt;relationship&gt; is complex.; What does this &lt;have to do with&gt; that?; The two &lt;are related&gt; somehow, but I don't know in what way.; The distance an arrow flies &lt;is related to&gt; the angle at which you shoot.; My science class and the smell of sulfur will forever &lt;be associated&gt; in my mind.; I don't see the &lt;connection&gt;.; There must be some sort of &lt;correlation&gt; between them.; I'm sure there is &lt;a link between&gt; the two, but I haven't found it yet.</Run>
</AStr>
</ExampleSentences>
<ExampleWords>
<AUni ws="en">be connected (with), be related (to), be linked (with), be associated (with), there is a link between, there is a connection between, be bound up with, go hand in hand, relate, relation, be a relationship between, relationship, have something to do with, be something to do with, be intertwined, tied, pertain, be relative to</AUni>
</ExampleWords>
