<ExampleSentences>
<AStr ws="en">
<Run ws="en">Do something &lt;with the purpose of&gt; something happening.; Do something &lt;for the sake of&gt; something happening.; Do something &lt;for the purpose of&gt; causing something to happen.; Do something &lt;in order to&gt; cause something to happen.; Do something &lt;to&gt; cause something to happen.; Do something &lt;in order that&gt; something might happen.; Do something &lt;so that&gt; something might happen.; Do something &lt;to show that&gt; something would happen.; Do something &lt;for&gt; some reason.; This medicine is good &lt;for&gt; malaria.</Run>
</AStr>
</ExampleSentences>
<ExampleWords>
<AUni ws="en">for, for the purpose of, for the sake of, with the purpose of, to, in order to, so that, to show that</AUni>
</ExampleWords>
