<Run ws="en">We will submit the file &lt;in accordance with&gt; the law.; He will be judged &lt;in accordance with&gt; his crime.; His grade &lt;corresponds to&gt; his performance.; You aren't acting &lt;in line with&gt; your beliefs.; You will benefit &lt;in proportion to&gt; your contribution.; What I have said &lt;applies to&gt; myself as well.</Run>
</AStr>
</ExampleSentences>
<ExampleWords>
<AUni ws="en">correspond to, correspondence, in accordance with, in relation to, according to, in line with, in proportion to, to apply to, to regard as applicable to, in keeping with</AUni>
</ExampleWords>
