<Description>
<AStr ws="en">
<Run ws="en">Use this domain for words related to God--the supreme being in the universe. Each theological system will have different beliefs concerning the existence and nature of God. Our purpose here is to collect and define the terms used to refer to the supreme deity. If there is no such person in the theological system, then use this domain for other terms for the pantheon of gods, ultimate reality, nirvana, and similar concepts. However most theological systems, even atheism, have the concept of a supreme God and use words to refer to him.</Run>
</AStr>
</Description>
<ForeColor val="0" />
<Hidden val="False" />
<IsProtected val="False" />
