<Description>
<AStr ws="en">
<Run ws="en">Use this domain for words referring to organizing things, people, events, and ideas--to think about and decide on the pattern a group of things should be arranged in, and then doing whatever is necessary to arrange them so that they can be used for some purpose. This domain is like the domain 'Arrange' except that 'Arrange' emphasizes physically moving the things, and the domain 'Organize' emphasizes the logical system. 'Organize' does not require that the things be moved, only that the logical pattern is specified.</Run>
</AStr>
</Description>
<ForeColor val="0" />
<Hidden val="False" />
<IsProtected val="False" />
